    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86034",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "NURSE.\nI am aweary, give me leave awhile;\nFie, how my bones ache! What a jaunt have I had!",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86034/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86034/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 41,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86034/line-3",
          "start": 42,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5385034,
        "end": 5385159,
        "line": 200247,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@86034",
        "anchor": "sceneII_30.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "NURSE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86163",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIET.\nI would thou hadst my bones, and I thy news:\nNay come, I pray thee speak; good, good Nurse, speak.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86163/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86163/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86163/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 106,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5385163,
        "end": 5385304,
        "line": 200253,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@86163",
        "anchor": "sceneII_30.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIET.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86308",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "NURSE.\nJesu, what haste? Can you not stay a while? Do you not see that I am out of breath?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86308/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86308/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 90,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5385308,
        "end": 5385429,
        "line": 200259,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@86308",
        "anchor": "sceneII_30.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "NURSE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIET.\nHow art thou out of breath, when thou hast breath\nTo say to me that thou art out of breath?\nThe excuse that thou dost make in this delay\nIs longer than the tale thou dost excuse.\nIs thy news good or bad? Answer to that;\nSay either, and I’ll stay the circumstance.\nLet me be satisfied, is’t good or bad?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 57,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-3",
          "start": 58,
          "end": 99,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-4",
          "start": 100,
          "end": 144,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-5",
          "start": 145,
          "end": 186,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-6",
          "start": 187,
          "end": 227,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-7",
          "start": 228,
          "end": 271,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86433/line-8",
          "start": 272,
          "end": 310,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5385433,
        "end": 5385803,
        "line": 200265,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@86433",
        "anchor": "sceneII_30.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "JULIET.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86807",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "NURSE.\nWell, you have made a simple choice; you know not how to choose a man. Romeo? No, not he. Though his face be better than any man’s, yet his leg excels all men’s, and for a hand and a foot, and a body, though they be not to be talked on, yet they are past compare. He is not the flower of courtesy, but I’ll warrant him as gentle as a lamb. Go thy ways, wench, serve God. What, have you dined at home?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86807/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@86807/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 407,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5385807,
        "end": 5386249,
        "line": 200276,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap30/p@86807",
        "anchor": "sceneII_30.5"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "NURSE.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@87253",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JULIET.\nNo, no. But all this did I know before.\nWhat says he of our marriage? What of that?",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@87253/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@87253/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 47,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "romeo-and-juliet/sceneII_30.5/p@87253/line-3",
          "start": 48,
          "end": 91,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 5386253,
        "end": 5386379,
        "line": 200286,
        "column": 1,
